    "en": {
      "trackName": "Pipe Plumber:Watch Games",
      "description": "Pipe Plumber is an offline pipe-connecting puzzle game for Apple Watch, iPhone and iPad. Tap to rotate tiles, line up their connections and link every tile to the source with no open ends.\n\nEnjoy a quick puzzle on your wrist or a larger board on your phone or tablet.\n\n• 30 levels: Explore 3×3, 4×4 and 5×5 boards. Choose any level from the start.\n• 8 visual themes: Switch between pipes, vines, city grids, stars and more without resetting your progress.\n• Three-star challenges: Solve without hints within the reference move count to earn three stars.\n• Helpful tools: Undo a move, get a hint for one tile or restart the level.\n• Watch controls: Tap a tile to rotate it, or enable Crown selection and tap the status row to turn the selected tile.\n• Automatic saves: Your board and progress are saved on the current device, ready for your next session.\n• Offline play: No internet connection or account required. No ads or in-app purchases.\n\nAvailable in English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, French, German and Italian.\n\nProgress is saved separately on iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch and does not sync between devices.\n\nTurn a tile. Make a connection. Find your way through every puzzle.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
